# Splanc MAX backup signing key (key id 4, "max_backup"): OFFLINE, kept in cold
# storage by the owner; only this public half is in the repo. Never a CI secret:
# nothing in CI signs with it. Trusted ONLY by the MAX (Raspberry Pi) updater. It
# signs the MAX key-epoch record that revokes a compromised `max` key (id 3), and
# the bridge image that carries the replacement key (docs/design/max-ota.md
# "Key rotation"). Generate it on an offline machine with
#   bazel run //firmware/ota:ota_sign -- keygen
# keep the `private` line offline, and replace UNSET with the `public` line.
UNSET
